\par}}}}\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb120\f6\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb244\f6\fs22\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li284\ri556\sl235\slmult1\f6\fs22\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 The input fields to the left are divided in 3 columns. The left column shows the current values as calculated\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 from the\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 model. The middle\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 column\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 shows\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 desired\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 values\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 which\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 can\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 be\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 modified\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 by the user. The right column shows the difference between the current and desired values. The left and right column are updated after each iteration so the progress can be monitored.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li284\ri440\sl235\slmult1\sb243\f6\fs22\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Below\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 these 3 columns the maximum number of iterations that may\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 be\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 performed can be\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 modified. The default is 15, but sometimes more iterations are needed to obtain the desired result. This is specially true when a design has a high prismatic coefficient in the aftship, such as planing motorcraft, or when the midship location is far from the usual place at 0.5*Length.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li284\ri569\sl232\slmult1\sb246\f6\fs22\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 The checkbox\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 below\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 that ensures that all windows\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 of the\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 program are updated after each iteration, so the progress can be monitored in 3D.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li284\ri569\sl235\slmult1\sb247\f6\fs22\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 To the right the bodyplan of the original hull is displayed in black. If the transformation was successful then\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 new\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 bodyplan\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 is\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 displayed\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 in\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 red\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 dashed\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 lines\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 on\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 top\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 of the\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 original bodyplan.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li284\ri483\sl235\slmult1\sb247\f6\fs22\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 At\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 bottom of the\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 dialog the\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 original\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 sectional\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 area\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 curve\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 and\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 design waterline\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 are\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 displayed, also in black. Again the new sectional area curve and design waterline are displayed on top of these if the transformation was successful. The dark gray dashed line is the location of the midship section as defined by the user in the project settings. Important to know is that in contrast to the\expnd16\expndtw80  \expnd0\expndtw0 hydrostatics calculated elsewhere in the program here it is calculated using ordinates, and not surface panels. This can cause a slight difference between the displacement shown here and calculated elsewhere. A total of 82 ordinates is used to calculate the sectional area curve and hydrostatics, 41 for the aftship and 41 for the foreship.\par\sect\sectd\sbkpage\headery852\footery852\margtsxn1300\margbsxn1040\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li284\ri456\sl235\slmult1\sb187\f6\fs22\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Finally\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 at the\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 bottom-left corner all layers of the model are\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 shown. The transformation is\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0{\ul only\expnd0\expndtw-2}\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 applied to the layers that have a checkmark next to them. As stated previously the transformation consists\expnd16\expndtw80  \expnd0\expndtw0 of shifting controlpoints longitudinally, so the location of for example a keel, centerboard or cabin is also likely to change. By removing the checkmark layers containing such items remain unchanged, but it may result in a distorted or unfair model if the model was excessively changed.\par
